东郡边塞，劫掠辽东郡所辖六县。","content_jianti_auto":"1春，高句骊王宫入辽东塞，寇略六县。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":3923,"number":1,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"95abc4a2-db0e-11ef-bb75-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"2夏，四月，庚午，赦天下，改元。","content_fanyi":"夏季，四月，庚午日，大赦天下，改换年号。","content_jianti_auto":"2夏，四月，庚午，赦天下，改元。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":3924,"number":2,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"95abc4a9-db0e-11ef-8f07-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"遼東太守","official_note":"遼東太守是漢朝遼東郡的最高行政長官，負責地方治理和軍事防禦。在《資治通鑑》此段中，耿夔擔任此職，率軍擊敗高句驪，體現其軍事指揮職能。","official_rank":"郡守级（约二千石）","source_snippet":"遼東太守耿夔擊高句驪，破之。","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"48dbdd81-0de9-4235-8aea-44a284864645"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_td_description":"耿夔，字定公，扶风郡茂陵（陕西省咸阳市西）人，东汉将领。","link_td_id":"Q10007344","link_td_number_id":4551862,"people_name":"耿夔","people_name_jianti_auto":"耿夔","people_xingming":"耿夔","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"95abc4ab-db0e-11ef-bfaf-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"遼東","place_name_jianti_auto":"辽东","resolved_place_entity_id":281,"start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"95abc4ac-db0e-11ef-a4fb-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"高句驪","place_name_jianti_auto":"高句骊","resolved_place_entity_id":226,"start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"95abc4ad-db0e-11ef-a162-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["军事"],"content":"3秋，九月，遼東太守耿夔擊高句驪，破之。","content_fanyi":"秋季九月，辽东郡太守耿夔进攻高句丽，将其击败。","content_jianti_auto":"3秋，九月，辽东太守耿夔击高句骊，破之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":3925,"number":3,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"95abc4aa-db0e-11ef-be8c-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[{"decision_name":"在皇子中选择继位者","decision_tongjian_id":"DECISION_95ABC4AEDB0E11EFB0F4A0D3651F611F_01"},{"decision_name":"处理宫中失窃案的方式","decision_tongjian_id":"DECISION_95ABC4AEDB0E11EFB0F4A0D3651F611F_02"},{"decision_name":"重新审理宠臣巫蛊案","decision_tongjian_id":"DECISION_95ABC4AEDB0E11EFB0F4A0D3651F611F_03"}],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"年二十七。","note_content_jianti_auto":"年二十七。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"95abc4af-db0e-11ef-b431-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"痼，音固。痼疾，堅久之疾也。長，知兩翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"痼，音固。痼疾，坚久之疾也。长，知两翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":70,"tongjian_id":"95abc4b0-db0e-11ef-8a34-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[{"relation_type":"forward_setup","source_end_index":26,"source_start_index":10,"source_text":"爲羣臣疑勝疾非痼、周章有異謀張本","target_paragraph_tongjian_id":"95c7545e-db0e-11ef-8dd4-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"勝","people_name_jianti_auto":"胜","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"95abc4b3-db0e-11ef-bcee-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"周章","people_name_jianti_auto":"周章","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"95abc4b4-db0e-11ef-b27d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"廢長立幼，卒以不終，爲羣臣疑勝疾非痼、周章有異謀張本。","note_content_jianti_auto":"废长立幼，卒以不终，为群臣疑胜疾非痼、周章有异谋张本。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":96,"tongjian_id":"95abc4b2-db0e-11ef-8122-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"考問則下之獄，辭所連及，必有無辜而被逮者。","note_content_jianti_auto":"考问则下之狱，辞所连及，必有无辜而被逮者。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":141,"tongjian_id":"95abc4b7-db0e-11ef-b463-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"和帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"和帝","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"95abc4ba-db0e-11ef-a676-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"幸人，常見幸於和帝者也。御者，卽侍者。辭，謂告者之辭。證，謂證佐也。下，遐稼翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"幸人，常见幸于和帝者也。御者，即侍者。辞，谓告者之辞。证，谓证佐也。下，遐稼翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":187,"tongjian_id":"95abc4b9-db0e-11ef-a953-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"吉成","people_name_jianti_auto":"吉成","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"95abc4bc-db0e-11ef-9cc9-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"謂婦人之情，有寵則上僭而生譖愬。吉成在先帝之時，后待之以恩，尚未嘗挾寵而有惡言加於后，今帝已晏駕，太后臨朝，不應反爲巫蠱。","note_content_jianti_auto":"谓妇人之情，有宠则上僭而生谮愬。吉成在先帝之时，后待之以恩，尚未尝挟宠而有恶言加于后，今帝已晏驾，太后临朝，不应反为巫蛊。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":219,"tongjian_id":"95abc4bb-db0e-11ef-930b-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"實覈者，審考其實也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"实核者，审考其实也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":232,"tongjian_id":"95abc4bd-db0e-11ef-9ee7-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"皇室储君","official_name":"皇太子","official_note":"皇太子是皇帝的继承人，此处指和帝少子隆被立为储君，以继承皇位。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"迎立以爲皇太子","start_index":78,"tongjian_id":"9fe487e2-036b-473d-b23d-b538a9e579dd"},{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"皇室尊号","official_name":"皇太后","official_note":"皇太后是皇帝的母亲或祖母的尊号，此处指邓皇后在和帝驾崩后被尊为皇太后，并临朝听政。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"尊皇后曰皇太后","start_index":88,"tongjian_id":"12f3201a-c297-4e57-9344-3d0dd5f0d89d"},{"confidence":0.85,"official_category":"宫廷侍从","official_name":"御者","official_note":"御者通常指驾车或侍奉的仆役，此处是吉成的侍从，涉及巫蛊案的诬告。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"和帝幸人吉成御者","start_index":172,"tongjian_id":"91a0980c-288b-4674-ac85-724602d66c35"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":81,"link_death_year":121,"link_td_description":"和熹皇后，名邓绥，为东汉和帝第二位皇后、东汉女政治家，南阳新野人（今河南省新野县）。","link_td_id":"Q10000178","link_td_number_id":104253,"people_name":"鄧皇后","people_name_jianti_auto":"邓皇后","people_xingming":"邓绥","start_index":51,"tongjian_id":"95abc4bf-db0e-11ef-9a64-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[邓绥]"},{"people_name":"勝","people_name_jianti_auto":"胜","people_xingming":"刘胜","start_index":64,"tongjian_id":"95abc4c0-db0e-11ef-9904-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":105,"link_death_year":106,"link_td_description":"汉殇帝刘隆，汉和帝幼子，养于民间，东汉第五位皇帝（106年在位），其正式谥号为「孝殇皇帝」，后世省略「孝」字称「汉殇帝」。汉殇帝是中国历史上即位年龄最小、寿命最短的皇帝。","link_td_id":"Q10000185","link_td_number_id":94235,"people_name":"隆","people_name_jianti_auto":"隆","people_xingming":"刘隆","start_index":72,"tongjian_id":"95abc4c1-db0e-11ef-a8b9-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":79,"link_death_year":106,"link_td_description":"汉和帝刘肇，东汉皇帝（88年4月9日－106年2月13日在位），在位17年，得年仅27岁，其正式谥号为「孝和皇帝」，后世省略「孝」字称「汉和帝」，他是汉明帝孙，章帝第四子，母贵人梁氏，死后庙号穆宗（后于汉献帝初平元年除去庙号），葬于慎陵。由于年幼即位，权力被外戚所挟制，及长后利用宦官权力扫除外戚威胁得以亲政。这开始了东汉戚宦相争的恶性循环。但和帝本人亲政后励精图治，四海升平，是东汉明章二帝后获评价最高的皇帝。","link_td_id":"Q10000183","link_td_number_id":103198,"people_name":"和帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"和帝","people_xingming":"刘肇","start_index":159,"tongjian_id":"95abc4c2-db0e-11ef-9c32-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[刘肇]"},{"people_name":"吉成","people_name_jianti_auto":"吉成","people_xingming":"吉成","start_index":163,"tongjian_id":"95abc4c3-db0e-11ef-948b-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"吉成","people_name_jianti_auto":"吉成","people_xingming":"吉成","start_index":169,"tongjian_id":"95abc4c4-db0e-11ef-9eb4-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"吉成","people_name_jianti_auto":"吉成","people_xingming":"吉成","start_index":190,"tongjian_id":"95abc4c5-db0e-11ef-963f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"95abc4ae-db0e-11ef-b0f4-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"hé","source_anchor_text":"自呼見實覈果御者所","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":224,"text":"覈","tongjian_id":"2b302028-886a-50a4-8ccb-6f287424509e"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"章德前殿","place_name_jianti_auto":"章德前殿","resolved_place_entity_id":5112,"start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"95abc4be-db0e-11ef-b968-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政","权争"],"content":"4冬，十二月，辛未，帝崩于章德前殿。初，帝失皇子，前後十數，後生者輒隱祕養於民間，羣臣無知者。及帝崩，鄧皇后乃收皇子於民間。長子勝，有痼疾；少子隆，生始百餘日，迎立以爲皇太子，是夜，卽皇帝位。尊皇后曰皇太后，太后臨朝。是時新遭大憂，法禁未設，宮中亡大珠一篋；太后念欲考問，必有不辜，乃親閱宮人，觀察顏色，卽時首服。又，和帝幸人吉成御者共枉吉成以巫蠱事，下掖庭考訊，辭證明白。太后以吉成先帝左右，待之有恩，平日尚無惡言，今反若此，不合人情；更自呼見實覈，果御者所爲，莫不歎服以爲聖明。","content_fanyi":"冬季，十二月辛未日，和帝在章德前殿驾崩。当初，和帝的皇子先后有十多人夭折，后来出生的皇子就总是被秘密送到民间抚养，群臣中无人知晓。等到和帝驾崩，邓皇后才从民间接回皇子。长子刘胜患有难以治愈的顽疾；幼子刘隆出生才一百多天，邓皇后将他迎入宫中，立为皇太子，当夜即皇帝位。尊皇后为皇太后，太后临朝听政。当时刚刚遭遇大丧，法令禁令尚未设立，宫中丢失了一箱大珠；太后心想，如果加以拷问，必定会牵连无辜，于是亲自查看宫女，观察她们的神色，偷珠者当即自首认罪。又，和帝的宠臣吉成，侍从们共同用巫蛊之事诬陷他，将他交付掖庭拷问审讯，供词和证据都很清楚。太后认为吉成是先帝身边的近臣，受到先帝恩遇，平日尚且没有恶言，如今反而这样，不合人情；于是又亲自召见核实，果然是侍从们所为，众人无不叹服，认为太后圣明。","content_jianti_auto":"4冬，十二月，辛未，帝崩于章德前殿。初，帝失皇子，前后十数，后生者辄隐秘养于民间，群臣无知者。及帝崩，邓皇后乃收皇子于民间。长子胜，有痼疾；少子隆，生始百余日，迎立以为皇太子，是夜，即皇帝位。尊皇后曰皇太后，太后临朝。是时新遭大忧，法禁未设，宫中亡大珠一箧；太后念欲考问，必有不辜，乃亲阅宫人，观察颜色，即时首服。又，和帝幸人吉成御者共枉吉成以巫蛊事，下掖庭考讯，辞证明白。太后以吉成先帝左右，待之有恩，平日尚无恶言，今反若此，不合人情；更自呼见实核，果御者所为，莫不叹服以为圣明。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[{"excerpts":[{"context_after":"，而无所窥望，庶几乎知命而安土以敦仁者乎！","context_before":"...没，和帝崇梁氏之礼，庆垂涕念母，欲求作祠堂而守礼不敢言，","source_end_index":154,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"b0d5e59b-c286-4eed-a03d-7cfd9a144ac8","source_start_index":142,"source_text":"和帝崩，立襁褓之子于民间"}],"title":"一 清河王庆有泰伯之德"}],"id":3926,"number":4,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"95abc4ae-db0e-11ef-b0f4-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"賢","people_name_jianti_auto":"贤","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"95abc4c9-db0e-11ef-9c4e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"賢曰：天子降大使至其國，卽遣子隨大使入侍。","note_content_jianti_auto":"贤曰：天子降大使至其国，即遣子随大使入侍。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"95abc4c8-db0e-11ef-998f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"北匈奴","place_name_jianti_auto":"北匈奴","resolved_place_entity_id":943,"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"95abc4ca-db0e-11ef-a005-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"敦煌","place_name_jianti_auto":"敦煌","resolved_place_entity_id":334,"start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"95abc4cb-db0e-11ef-9566-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[{"title":"东汉与匈奴的战争","tongjian_id":"war_N0608"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["外交"],"content":"5北匈奴重遣使詣敦煌貢獻，辭以國貧未能備禮，願請大使，當遣子入侍。太后亦不答其使，加賜而已。","content_fanyi":"北匈奴再次派遣使者到敦煌进贡，以国家贫困、无法备办齐全的礼物为辞，希望汉朝派出使节，他们将送王子入朝侍奉。邓太后也没有答复其使者，只是增加赏赐而已。","content_jianti_auto":"5北匈奴重遣使诣敦煌贡献，辞以国贫未能备礼，愿请大使，当遣子入侍。太后亦不答其使，加赐而已。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":3927,"number":5,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"95abc4c6-db0e-11ef-a5db-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"卒于官也。卒，子恤翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"卒于官也。卒，子恤翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":56,"tongjian_id":"95abc4cf-db0e-11ef-a7fc-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"張","people_name_jianti_auto":"张","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"95ae0ec6-db0e-11ef-b871-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"note_content":"『張：「市」作「帀」。』","note_content_jianti_auto":"『张：「市」作「帀」。』","note_type":"『張：[^』]*』","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"95ae0ec5-db0e-11ef-9a3c-a0d3651f611f"}],"note_content":"","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":59,"tongjian_id":"95ae0ec4-db0e-11ef-bdc3-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"渙","people_name_jianti_auto":"涣","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"95ae0ec8-db0e-11ef-be25-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"以祭渙也，槃以盛祭物，案以陳槃，今野人之祭猶然。","note_content_jianti_auto":"以祭涣也，槃以盛祭物，案以陈槃，今野人之祭犹然。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":87,"tongjian_id":"95ae0ec7-db0e-11ef-bcb6-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"賢","people_name_jianti_auto":"贤","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"95ae0eca-db0e-11ef-87cc-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"賢曰：鈔，掠也。余謂此言鈔者，非至如盜賊之鈔掠，特不以道而侵取之，故曰鈔；音楚交翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"贤曰：钞，掠也。余谓此言钞者，非至如盗贼之钞掠，特不以道而侵取之，故曰钞；音楚交翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":109,"tongjian_id":"95ae0ec9-db0e-11ef-a179-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"在事，謂在官當事也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"在事，谓在官当事也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":120,"tongjian_id":"95ae0ecc-db0e-11ef-83b1-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"以所作詩被之弦歌也。爲，于僞翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"以所作诗被之弦歌也。为，于伪翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":151,"tongjian_id":"95ae0ecd-db0e-11ef-9142-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"雒陽令","official_note":"雒陽令是漢代首都洛陽的縣令，負責地方行政和司法，此處指王渙擔任此職，在文中描述其治理有方，深受百姓愛戴。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"雒陽令廣漢王渙","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"781687f8-6b7a-444c-a659-333a6cb05a49"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"文教或近侍","official_name":"郞中","official_note":"郞中是漢代官職，常為皇帝近侍或參與文教事務，此處太后任命王渙之子為郞中，以表彰王渙的功績，體現獎勵機制。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"今以渙子石爲郞中","start_index":180,"tongjian_id":"f0b705d8-d7ea-4c23-925d-e17b62fea15d"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":105,"link_td_description":"王涣，字稚子，广汉郡郪县（今四川省中江县东南）人，东汉政治人物。","link_td_id":"Q10020254","link_td_number_id":6201870,"people_name":"廣漢","people_name_jianti_auto":"广汉","people_xingming":"王涣","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"95ae0ecf-db0e-11ef-bbc6-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[四川梓潼]"},{"link_death_year":105,"link_td_description":"王涣，字稚子，广汉郡郪县（今四川省中江县东南）人，东汉政治人物。","link_td_id":"Q10020254","link_td_number_id":6201870,"people_name":"王渙","people_name_jianti_auto":"王涣","people_xingming":"王涣","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"95ae0ed0-db0e-11ef-ba7c-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":105,"link_td_description":"王涣，字稚子，广汉郡郪县（今四川省中江县东南）人，东汉政治人物。","link_td_id":"Q10020254","link_td_number_id":6201870,"people_name":"渙","people_name_jianti_auto":"涣","people_xingming":"王涣","start_index":68,"tongjian_id":"95ae0ed3-db0e-11ef-98cb-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":105,"link_td_description":"王涣，字稚子，广汉郡郪县（今四川省中江县东南）人，东汉政治人物。","link_td_id":"Q10020254","link_td_number_id":6201870,"people_name":"王君","people_name_jianti_auto":"王君","people_xingming":"王涣","start_index":115,"tongjian_id":"95ae0ed6-db0e-11ef-8a10-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":105,"link_td_description":"王涣，字稚子，广汉郡郪县（今四川省中江县东南）人，东汉政治人物。","link_td_id":"Q10020254","link_td_number_id":6201870,"people_name":"渙","people_name_jianti_auto":"涣","start_index":184,"tongjian_id":"95ae0ed8-db0e-11ef-ba69-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"石","people_name_jianti_auto":"石","people_xingming":"王石","start_index":186,"tongjian_id":"95ae0ed9-db0e-11ef-b4da-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"95abc4cc-db0e-11ef-8707-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"tī","source_anchor_text":"以明察發擿姦伏外行","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":19,"text":"擿","tongjian_id":"98675291-a837-5d87-8cf8-5cfcb45867bd"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"雒陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"雒阳","resolved_place_entity_id":56,"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"95ae0ed1-db0e-11ef-8991-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"京師","place_name_jianti_auto":"京师","resolved_place_entity_id":56,"start_index":44,"tongjian_id":"95ae0ed2-db0e-11ef-b0e3-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"弘農","place_name_jianti_auto":"弘农","resolved_place_entity_id":473,"start_index":75,"tongjian_id":"95ae0ed4-db0e-11ef-8b88-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"雒","place_name_jianti_auto":"雒","resolved_place_entity_id":56,"start_index":101,"tongjian_id":"95ae0ed5-db0e-11ef-b1c2-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"雒陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"雒阳","resolved_place_entity_id":56,"start_index":131,"tongjian_id":"95ae0ed7-db0e-11ef-8453-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["人事","内政"],"content":"6雒陽令廣漢王渙，居身平正，能以明察發擿姦伏，外行猛政，內懷慈仁。凡所平斷，人莫不悅服，京師以爲有神，是歲卒官，百姓市道，莫不咨嗟流涕。渙喪西歸，道經弘農，民庶皆設槃案於路，吏問其故，咸言：「平常持米到雒，爲吏卒所鈔，恆亡其半，自王君在事，不見侵枉，故來報恩。」雒陽民爲立祠、作詩，每祭，輒弦歌而薦之。太后詔曰：「夫忠良之吏，國家之所以爲治也，求之甚勤，得之至寡，今以渙子石爲郞中，以勸勞勤。」","content_fanyi":"洛阳令、广汉人王涣，立身端正公平，能够凭借明察揭发隐藏的奸邪；他表面上推行严厉的政令，内心却怀有仁慈。凡是他审理裁决的案件，人们无不心悦诚服，京城中人都觉得他有神明相助。这一年他在官任上去世，百姓在街市道路上无不叹息流泪。王涣的灵柩向西归乡，途中经过弘农，当地百姓都在路边摆设盘案，官吏询问原因，他们都说：“平日我们运米到洛阳，常被官吏和兵卒抢掠，总是损失一半；自从王君在任，不再受到侵扰和冤枉，所以前来报恩。”洛阳百姓为王涣建立祠堂、创作诗歌，每到祭祀时，就弹琴歌唱进献祭品。邓太后下诏说：“忠良的官吏，是国家得以治理的依靠。朝廷寻求他们十分勤切，得到的却很少。现在任命王涣的儿子王石为郎中，用来勉励勤勉辛劳的官吏。”","content_jianti_auto":"6雒阳令广汉王涣，居身平正，能以明察发擿奸伏，外行猛政，内怀慈仁。凡所平断，人莫不悦服，京师以为有神，是岁卒官，百姓市道，莫不咨嗟流涕。涣丧西归，道经弘农，民庶皆设槃案于路，吏问其故，咸言：「平常持米到雒，为吏卒所钞，恒亡其半，自王君在事，不见侵枉，故来报恩。」雒阳民为立祠、作诗，每祭，辄弦歌而荐之。太后诏曰：「夫忠良之吏，国家之所以为治也，求之甚勤，得之至寡，今以涣子石为郞中，以劝劳勤。」","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":3928,"number":6,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"95abc4cc-db0e-11ef-8707-a0d3651f611f"}],"reign_name":"元興元年","reign_name_jianti_auto":"元兴元年","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"95abc4a0-db0e-11ef-b2d2-a0d3651f611f","year_anno":"（乙巳、一○五）","year_int":105},"message":"success","success":true}